Couple of funny pet stories...

Once I was on level 2, and found a wand of polymorph.
Soon had a pet troll, but I managed to die anyway.

On a later incarnation, I ran into my pet troll again.  Luckily, it
was still friendly, until I accidentally ran into it.  You can tame
pets again by throwing food at it, but not if they're trolls.

---

Second story: I used to name my dog 'the invisible stalker' so
when I died, and another player found my bones level...

Never knew what hit them until the gravestone says "killed by
a little dog named the invisible stalker"

